      "title": "No Ethernet",
      "text": "The Model A has no network port; networking needs a USB adapter on its single USB port, so a powered hub is usually needed for anything more.",
      "source": "rpi-docs-source"
    },
    {
      "title": "3.3 V only",
      "text": "The GPIO pins are 3.3 V. Do not connect 5 V signals or components to them.",
